# Rendered by paisans. Do not edit: `paisans apply` overwrites this file.
#
# Routing for status, imported by the host block for
# status.example.org in the Caddy on the monitor's own site. The UI, sign in,
# the OIDC callback, heartbeat URLs (/ping/*) and the UI's own session
# authenticated JSON (/api/sites*, which the dashboard's live refresh and the
# response time chart fetch) pass. The status page, badges, /metrics and the
# token API (/api/v1/*) are refused here whatever the app's own settings say:
# the status page lists every monitor, mesh addresses included, and /metrics
# is public whenever no API token exists, which under this toolkit is always.
@refused path /status* /badge/* /metrics /api/v1/*
respond @refused 404
reverse_proxy 10.44.0.4:3001 {
	header_up X-Forwarded-Proto https
}
